e original graphic.","existing_ingest_key":"WORKC_1129_2094:WORKC_G01_P04:RULE:kr-013227-287835-ko#body_addenda_annex_forms:en","existing_law_id":"i18n-974f143cfd2aef2a266a2e6a5fd6c5a77582a241cb5b22c0","existing_payload_sha256":"f76de4438066114c9c656acb8dc410f40e27d54ed8285a60503e47e8e1bb87d7","existing_receipt":{"body_sha256":"8c24cd93b87bcf0c68a8cecbda53438041cfbaba25eb7241041a8b16324e780f","committed_at":"2026-10-19T10:36:29+00:00","ingest_key":"WORKC_1129_2094:WORKC_G01_P04:RULE:kr-013227-287835-ko#body_addenda_annex_forms:en","law_id":"i18n-974f143cfd2aef2a266a2e6a5fd6c5a77582a241cb5b22c0","original_count":1,"payload_sha256":"f76de4438066114c9c656acb8dc410f40e27d54ed8285a60503e47e8e1bb87d7","unit_count":56},"existing_unit_body_sha256":"43af4f10d9a9368690aa83f1a2156e59ae0674e672f335e3249eda62f0ac60e0","existing_unit_full_text":"■ Enforcement Rule of the Act on Management of Firefighting Equipment [Attached Table 1]\n\nMethods of Certification Marking and Marking of Confirmation of Exemption for Fire Equipment\n(Re: Article 13 (3) and Article 14 (1))\n\n1. Method of certification marking for fire equipment\n\n(a) Design\n\nKFAC\nFIRE EQUIPMENT CERTIFICATION\n\n| Certification number: | |\n|---|---|\n| Certification institution: | |\n\n(b) Marking instructions\n\n1) The certification mark may be proportionally scaled according to the position and structure of the fire equipment.\n\n2) The certification mark shall be clearly visible and shall be affixed, printed, engraved, or otherwise indicated on the surface of the fire equipment or its packaging. It shall not be easily erased or detached.\n\n3) The colors of the certification mark design may differ in consideration of the product, packaging, etc.\n\n4) Where it is difficult to place the certification mark on the surface of the fire equipment, or where a fire service agency or end user purchases a large quantity of fire equipment for direct use and there is no risk of the equipment being circulated on the market, the mark may be placed on each smallest packaging unit of the fire equipment.\n\n2. Method of marking confirmation of exemption from certification of fire equipment\n\n(a) Fire equipment exempted from certification shall bear the marking “Proof of Confirmation of Exemption from Fire Equipment Certification” on the surface of the fire equipment or its packaging.\n\n(b) Paragraph 1 (b) shall apply mutatis mutandis to instructions for marking confirmation of exemption.","existing_unit_key":"annex-000100E","matrix_counted_elsewhere":true,"source_component_text_sha256":"0ade826e2ef71eeface11800296421b1a7ff6a523c32b0ae48848ab8afec8995","source_unit_evidence_sha256":"12bedf3e513db7415f17c4da9f36c59ac31f3bc0fe9d95853aaf2116cbd90d76","source_unit_key":"annex-000100E"},{"additional_matrix_weight":0,"existing_full_text_body_sha256":"8c24cd93b87bcf0c68a8cecbda53438041cfbaba25eb7241041a8b16324e780f","existing_graphic_annotation":"Inside a blue circular border is an orange-toned flame design bearing the white lettering “KFAC” and “Fire Equipment Certification”. Small English lettering runs around the lower part of the circle. Its exact spelling and capitalization are not inferred in this transcription and remain preserved in the original graphic.","existing_ingest_key":"WORKC_1129_2094:WORKC_G01_P04:RULE:kr-013227-287835-ko#body_addenda_annex_forms:en","existing_law_id":"i18n-974f143cfd2aef2a266a2e6a5fd6c5a77582a241cb5b22c0","existing_payload_sha256":"f76de4438066114c9c656acb8dc410f40e27d54ed8285a60503e47e8e1bb87d7","existing_receipt":{"body_sha256":"8c24cd93b87bcf0c68a8cecbda53438041cfbaba25eb7241041a8b16324e780f","committed_at":"2026-10-19T10:36:29+00:00","ingest_key":"WORKC_1129_2094:WORKC_G01_P04:RULE:kr-013227-287835-ko#body_addenda_annex_forms:en","law_id":"i18n-974f143cfd2aef2a266a2e6a5fd6c5a77582a241cb5b22c0","original_count":1,"payload_sha256":"f76de4438066114c9c656acb8dc410f40e27d54ed8285a60503e47e8e1bb87d7","unit_count":56},"existing_unit_body_sha256":"869bc29d81f4a91675b90e317f25a41e4e5f94439cf749fa3e248a0788342d3b","existing_unit_full_text":"■ Enforcement Rule of the Act on Management of Firefighting Equipment [Attached Form 4]\n\nKFAC\nFIRE EQUIPMENT CERTIFICATION\n\nWritten Designation of a Certification Institution for Fire Equipment\n\n1. Designation number: No.\n2. Institution name:\n3. Address:\n4. Scope of certification services:\n\nThe above institution is hereby designated as a certification institution for fire equipment under Article 14 (1) of the Act on Management of Firefighting Equipment, Article 19 (3) of its Enforcement Decree, and Article 11 (3) of its Enforcement Rule.\n\nYear:          Month:          Day:\n\nFire Commissioner of the National Fire Agency                    [Official seal]\n\n210 mm × 297 mm [White paper, 150 g/m²]","existing_unit_key":"form-000400F","matrix_counted_elsewhere":true,"source_component_text_sha256":"0716f7b9f2c145a93cc573160846736210be1a075d7e1950b74b0e4db5b54500","source_unit_evidence_sha256":"b62162ed46aae8a19ce5df84947f2944a33558d90ccad14575aff53012aa98d2","source_unit_key":"form-000400F"}],"scope":"GRAPHIC_TRANSCRIPTION_SUPPLEMENT","source_body_sha256":"c41b68f4391515ea1e0e4c2f6e211bf0cfacd2ce38e94b0a225702ff1b6a35e1","source_component_text_sha256":"f18d039ae2ee4ff337a9a1f62d3504c899e64231b18ca0db75ab31b4511a3631","source_graphic_sha256":"cc17d5cdf3a340263f9bf25b0169a7e7ea8bb946ee83312279d1838685b96733","source_inventory_record":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\inventory_v1\\inventory_manifest_v1.json","sha256":"6c04b2b3b1dcf31aa026e387f4100b598aaeec3a86b7fbe94fc33e2f15bd3067"},"source_matrix_unit_count":0,"source_unit_count":1,"source_unit_map":[{"kind":"OTHER","matrix_counted":false,"source_component_text_sha256":"f18d039ae2ee4ff337a9a1f62d3504c899e64231b18ca0db75ab31b4511a3631","source_graphic_sha256":"cc17d5cdf3a340263f9bf25b0169a7e7ea8bb946